## Parameter definitions and recovery

`extension.parameters` declares installation and instance parameters. The
resource-level `parameters` attribute supplies installation values. Defaults and
Enum options in definitions must follow the declared parameter type. These
Extension rules differ from App Definition parameter validation.

Read and import preserve existing definitions and field types. Updates validate
the complete planned definitions and field types, including values retained by
`ignore_changes`.
Configuration must also be valid for `terraform destroy`; correct the
configuration first, then destroy without applying the correction to Contentful.

